{"id":"2a55bf7c4b509350","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-oracle-machine-notation.md","title":"73-df-oracle-machine-notation — oracle machine notation","display":"73-df-oracle-machine-notation — oracle machine notation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-oracle-machine-notation","display":"73-df-oracle-machine-notation — oracle machine notation","depends_on":["[[73-df-oracle-program-semantics]]","[[73-df-numeric-program-interface]]"],"aliases":["73-df-oracle-machine-notation","73-definition-10.12"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-oracle-machine-notation"},{"key":"display","html":"73-df-oracle-machine-notation — oracle machine notation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ab6c7ca255afa826\" href=\"?note=ab6c7ca255afa826\" title=\"73-df-oracle-program-semantics\">73-df-oracle-program-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"219767ec839d8c84\" href=\"?note=219767ec839d8c84\" title=\"73-df-numeric-program-interface\">73-df-numeric-program-interface</a></span></div>"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-oracle-machine-notation</span><span>73-definition-10.12</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\{\\mathbb N,\\mathbf2^*\\}\">\\(X\\in\\{\\mathbb N,\\mathbf2^*\\}\\)</span> 是固定载体，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq X\">\\(A\\subseteq X\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"219767ec839d8c84\" href=\"?note=219767ec839d8c84\" title=\"73-df-numeric-program-interface\">73-df-numeric-program-interface</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OTM}_B\">\\(\\operatorname{OTM}_B\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^B\">\\(L^B\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OHalts}_O^B\">\\(\\operatorname{OHalts}_O^B\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ab6c7ca255afa826\" href=\"?note=ab6c7ca255afa826\" title=\"73-df-oracle-program-semantics\">73-df-oracle-program-semantics</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{repr}_X\">\\(\\operatorname{repr}_X\\)</span> 在数值载体上取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span>，在二进制词载体上取恒等；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_X\">\\(A_X\\)</span> 为表示后的神谕。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OracleTM}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{OracleTM}(A)\\)</span> 保留原“机器集合”接口。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M^A\">\\(M^A\\)</span> 显式为程序及神谕组成的有序对；其 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 以原载体 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 为输入。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TM}^A\">\\(\\mathrm{TM}^A\\)</span> 是下述定义的带固定神谕 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的程序—神谕有序对类；其程序分量取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OracleTM}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{OracleTM}(A)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M^A\">\\(M^A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(M^A)\">\\(L(M^A)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M^A(x)\\downarrow\">\\(M^A(x)\\downarrow\\)</span> 的语义子句中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\mathrm{OracleTM}(A)\">\\(M\\in\\mathrm{OracleTM}(A)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in X\">\\(x\\in X\\)</span>；类定义中的程序变量在其各自的成员条件内绑定。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 的类型标注把载体参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 保留在接口实例中；省略标注的旧写法 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(M^A)\">\\(L(M^A)\\)</span> 取该固定实例。即使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=\\varnothing\">\\(A=\\varnothing\\)</span>，数值实例与词实例也不因程序—神谕有序对相同而合并。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.12}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{repr}_X\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\beta,&amp;X=\\mathbb N,\\\\\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathbf2^*},&amp;X=\\mathbf2^*,\\end{cases}\\qquad\nA_X\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{repr}_X(x):x\\in A\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.12}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{repr}_X\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\beta,&amp;X=\\mathbb N,\\\\\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathbf2^*},&amp;X=\\mathbf2^*,\\end{cases}\\qquad\nA_X\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{repr}_X(x):x\\in A\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.12}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{OracleTM}(A)\\coloneqq\\{O:\\operatorname{OTM}_{A_X}(O)\\},\\qquad\nM^A\\coloneqq(M,A),\\qquad\\mathrm{TM}^A\\coloneqq\\{M^A:M\\in\\mathrm{OracleTM}(A)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.12}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{OracleTM}(A)\\coloneqq\\{O:\\operatorname{OTM}_{A_X}(O)\\},\\qquad\nM^A\\coloneqq(M,A),\\qquad\\mathrm{TM}^A\\coloneqq\\{M^A:M\\in\\mathrm{OracleTM}(A)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.12}\\vdash\n\\bigl(L:\\mathrm{TM}^A\\to\\mathcal P(X)\\bigr)(M^A)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in X:\\operatorname{repr}_X(x)\\in L^{A_X}(M)\\},\\qquad\nM^A(x)\\downarrow\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{OHalts}_M^{A_X}(\\operatorname{repr}_X(x))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.12}\\vdash\n\\bigl(L:\\mathrm{TM}^A\\to\\mathcal P(X)\\bigr)(M^A)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in X:\\operatorname{repr}_X(x)\\in L^{A_X}(M)\\},\\qquad\nM^A(x)\\downarrow\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{OHalts}_M^{A_X}(\\operatorname{repr}_X(x))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.12}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{repr}_X:X\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\mathbf2^*,\\qquad A_X\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.12}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{repr}_X:X\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\mathbf2^*,\\qquad A_X\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条目保留原调用记号；参数与类型由 Hypothesis 固定，Assertion 给出完整定义或结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-oracle-program-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"ab6c7ca255afa826","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-oracle-program-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-numeric-program-interface","status":"resolved","id":"219767ec839d8c84","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-numeric-program-interface]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-numeric-program-interface","status":"resolved","id":"219767ec839d8c84","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X\\in\\{\\mathbb N,\\mathbf2^*\\}$ 是固定载体，$A\\subseteq X$；$\\beta$ 见 [[73-df-numeric-program-interface]]，$\\operatorname{OTM}_B$, $L^B$, $\\operatorname{OHalts}_O^B$ 见 [[73-df-oracle-program-semantics]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-oracle-program-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"ab6c7ca255afa826","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X\\in\\{\\mathbb N,\\mathbf2^*\\}$ 是固定载体，$A\\subseteq X$；$\\beta$ 见 [[73-df-numeric-program-interface]]，$\\operatorname{OTM}_B$, $L^B$, $\\operatorname{OHalts}_O^B$ 见 [[73-df-oracle-program-semantics]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in\\{\\mathbb N,\\mathbf2^*\\}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq X","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{OTM}_B","display":false},{"tex":"L^B","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{OHalts}_O^B","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{repr}_X","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"A_X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OracleTM}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"M^A","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TM}^A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OracleTM}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"M^A","display":false},{"tex":"L(M^A)","display":false},{"tex":"M^A(x)\\downarrow","display":false},{"tex":"M\\in\\mathrm{OracleTM}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in X","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"L(M^A)","display":false},{"tex":"A=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.12}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{repr}_X\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\beta,&X=\\mathbb N,\\\\\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathbf2^*},&X=\\mathbf2^*,\\end{cases}\\qquad\nA_X\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{repr}_X(x):x\\in A\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.12}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{OracleTM}(A)\\coloneqq\\{O:\\operatorname{OTM}_{A_X}(O)\\},\\qquad\nM^A\\coloneqq(M,A),\\qquad\\mathrm{TM}^A\\coloneqq\\{M^A:M\\in\\mathrm{OracleTM}(A)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.12}\\vdash\n\\bigl(L:\\mathrm{TM}^A\\to\\mathcal P(X)\\bigr)(M^A)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in X:\\operatorname{repr}_X(x)\\in L^{A_X}(M)\\},\\qquad\nM^A(x)\\downarrow\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{OHalts}_M^{A_X}(\\operatorname{repr}_X(x))","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.12}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{repr}_X:X\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\mathbf2^*,\\qquad A_X\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*","display":true}],"bytes":2370,"backlinks":[{"id":"8cd0bb12bb71a086","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PolyTM}^B$ 是带固定神谕的对象集合；$\\mathrm{TM}^B$、$L(M^B)$ 使用 [[73-df-oracle-machine-notation]] 的词载体实例。"},{"id":"081e619277708cc0","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；数值神谕机接口 $\\mathrm{OracleTM}(B),M^B,L(M^B)$ 与 $M^B(x)\\downarrow$ 见 [[73-df-oracle-machine-notation]]，固定其载体 $X=\\mathbb N$。"}],"outgoing":["ab6c7ca255afa826","219767ec839d8c84"]}